{"messages":[{"content":"","role":"system","sections":{"cwd":"<cwd>\n[path:e17a18956d69ff7cbdb9]\n</cwd>","docs":"<docs>\nPi documentation (read only when the user asks about the harness itself, its SDK, extensions, themes, skills, or TUI):\n- Main documentation: [path:d82ac5af04c0100a85ce]\n- Additional docs: [path:bb144c96a9d247c07d6f]\n- Examples: [path:0326e6e587bc39169964] (extensions, custom tools, SDK)\n- When reading pi docs or examples, resolve docs/... under Additional docs and examples/... under Examples, not the current working directory\n- When asked about: extensions (docs/extensions.md, examples/extensions/), themes (docs/themes.md), skills (docs/skills.md), prompt templates (docs/prompt-templates.md), TUI components (docs/tui.md), keybindings (docs/keybindings.md), SDK integrations (docs/sdk.md), custom providers (docs/custom-provider.md), adding models (docs/models.md), packages (docs/packages.md), environment variables (docs/environment-variables.md), MCP servers (docs/mcp.md), codemode scripts and non-LLM models such as classifiers and image models (docs/codemode.md)\n- Before implementing harness changes, read the relevant docs and examples in full, following related cross-references.\n</docs>","preamble":"You are a coding assistant running inside pi, a coding agent harness. Help users inspect files, run commands, and modify code.","rules":"<rules>\n- Use bash for file operations like ls, rg, find\n- Use read to examine files instead of cat or sed.\n- You can inspect PI_* environment variables for current model and session details.\n- Use edit for targeted changes. Batch changes to one file in a single call.\n- Each edits[].oldText must exactly and uniquely match the original file. Keep matches short and non-overlapping; merge nearby changes without including large unchanged regions.\n- Use write only for new files or complete rewrites.\n- Use codemode to batch independent tool calls (Promise.allSettled), chain them, or filter large output, instead of many separate calls.\n- Be concise in your responses\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files\n</rules>","skills":"<skills>\nThe following skills provide specialized instructions for specific tasks.\nUse the read tool to load a skill's file when the task matches its description.\nResolve relative paths against the skill's directory (parent of SKILL.md). Use absolute paths in tool calls.\n\n<available_skills>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:48a84c1ae8e247db6003]</name>\n    <description>松涛51配送方式报价规则</description>\n    <location>[path:980d60483d6853eab1ef]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:047f7cf18eb447e105c3]</name>\n    <description>松涛53外发报表个人信息处理</description>\n    <location>[path:d7c3f7f6e84ed71d2b7e]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:09623e3c729fffd6ee93]</name>\n    <description>松涛53交易金额对账</description>\n    <location>[path:47db254e7b5b0e50ee3a]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:06f337cb608e803a0f47]</name>\n    <description>松涛39包裹运输路由规则</description>\n    <location>[path:d0a564e5e61b25c8c486]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:3273900c18323a4eafbe]</name>\n    <description>松涛12发票含税金额计算</description>\n    <location>[path:46ade07013506343d564]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:6f3f39988438e796905f]</name>\n    <description>松涛12按行计算税额</description>\n    <location>[path:90d56c7609815b39f800]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:2afd5579b9b4f4670b87]</name>\n    <description>松涛73退货审批政策</description>\n    <location>[path:76b8f312c34b5460932f]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:708a7d053c4b7bbb836e]</name>\n    <description>松涛92包裹运输路由规则</description>\n    <location>[path:ef28176b021460923fb0]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:a74f28a9b2575cb8da08]</name>\n    <description>松涛98区域资助资格政策</description>\n    <location>[path:465f7fc5923d44829123]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:a8b0d1818cc535c1b759]</name>\n    <description>松涛44仓库批次清单整理</description>\n    <location>[path:4d1746f022ae4bd44975]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:f39cfadb581363d708da]</name>\n    <description>仅处理会议座位编排</description>\n    <location>[path:de6bec417bfdf521dc9d]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:6a14c1e90ffb2f4a4bdb]</name>\n    <description>仅处理图书馆借阅标签</description>\n    <location>[path:e11b42cfc04648992b59]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:9c8fd14c6ea6340dc3a1]</name>\n    <description>仅处理摄影文件命名</description>\n    <location>[path:1101e4a03762a847715c]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:f3878d3b1b9951c080eb]</name>\n    <description>仅处理运动器材盘点</description>\n    <location>[path:c4f72d596dc7c5ab5936]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:9b1480db222797690445]</name>\n    <description>仅处理菜园采收日志</description>\n    <location>[path:aacf6d6ec3ea9838dba0]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identity:8d9064601c6ab3c0c0d6]</name>\n    <description>松涛40库存补货规则</description>\n    <location>[path:67840aec69a2155fcb4f]</location>\n  </skill>\n</available_skills>\n</skills>","tools":"<tools>\n- read: Read file contents\n- bash: Execute bash commands (ls, grep, find, etc.)\n- edit: Make precise file edits with exact text replacement, including multiple disjoint edits in one call\n- write: Create or overwrite files\n- codemode: Run JavaScript that calls other tools\n- tool_search: Search for tools that are not loaded yet and load the matches\n\nAdditional tools may be available.\n</tools>"},"timestamp":1795610312932,"toolsAdded":[{"constrainedSampling":{"strict":"prefer","type":"json_schema"},"description":"Read the contents of a file. Supports text files and images (jpg, png, gif, webp, bmp). Images are sent as attachments. For text files, output is truncated to 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). Use offset/limit for large files. When you need the full file, continue with offset until complete.\n\nCodemode: `tools.read(args)` resolves to `string | { data: string; mimeType: string; note: string; type: \"image\"; }`.","name":"read","parameters":{"properties":{"limit":{"description":"Maximum number of lines to read","type":"number"},"offset":{"description":"Line number to start reading from (1-indexed)","type":"number"},"path":{"description":"Path to the file to read (relative or absolute)","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},{"constrainedSampling":{"strict":"prefer","type":"json_schema"},"description":"Execute a bash command in the current working directory. Returns stdout and stderr. Output is truncated to last 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). If truncated, full output is saved to a temp file. Optionally provide a timeout in seconds.\n\nCodemode: `tools.bash(args)` resolves to `{ output, truncated, full_output_path?, exit_code, wall_time_seconds }`.","name":"bash","parameters":{"properties":{"command":{"description":"Shell command to execute","type":"string"},"timeout":{"description":"Timeout in seconds (optional, no default timeout)","type":"number"}},"required":["command"],"type":"object"}},{"constrainedSampling":{"strict":"prefer","type":"json_schema"},"description":"Edit a single file using exact text replacement. Every edits[].oldText must match a unique, non-overlapping region of the original file. If two changes affect the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead of emitting overlapping edits. Do not include large unchanged regions just to connect distant changes.\n\nCodemode: `tools.edit(args)` resolves to a string.","name":"edit","parameters":{"properties":{"edits":{"description":"One or more targeted replacements. Each edit is matched against the original file, not incrementally. Do not include overlapping or nested edits. If two changes touch the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead.","items":{"properties":{"newText":{"description":"Replacement text for this targeted edit.","type":"string"},"oldText":{"description":"Exact text for one targeted replacement. It must be unique in the original file and must not overlap with any other edits[].oldText in the same call.","type":"string"}},"required":["oldText","newText"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"path":{"description":"Path to the file to edit (relative or absolute)","type":"string"}},"required":["path","edits"],"type":"object"}},{"constrainedSampling":{"strict":"prefer","type":"json_schema"},"description":"Write content to a file. Creates the file if it doesn't exist, overwrites if it does. Automatically creates parent directories.\n\nCodemode: `tools.write(args)` resolves to a string.","name":"write","parameters":{"properties":{"content":{"description":"Content to write to the file","type":"string"},"path":{"description":"Path to the file to write (relative or absolute)","type":"string"}},"required":["path","content"],"type":"object"}},{"constrainedSampling":{"type":"grammar","variants":{"openai_lark":"\nstart: options_source | plain_source\noptions_source: OPTIONS_LINE NEWLINE SOURCE\nplain_source: SOURCE\n\nOPTIONS_LINE: /[ \\t]*\\/\\/ @options:[^\\r\\n]*/\nNEWLINE: /\\r?\\n/\nSOURCE: /[\\s\\S]+/\n"}},"description":"Run JavaScript that calls other tools. The input is raw JavaScript (not JSON, no code fence), run as an async function body in a QuickJS sandbox: top-level `await` and `return` work. No Node, file system, network, or timers.\n- `await tools.<name>({ ...args })` resolves to a string, or an object if the tool's declaration says so, and rejects with an Error on failure. A tool whose declaration returns an object resolves on failure too when it returned that object; check its fields. Calls still running when the script ends are cancelled.\n- Optional first line: `// @options: {\"max_output_tokens\": 10000, \"timeout_ms\": 60000}`\n\nGlobals:\n- `text(value)`, `image(dataUrlOrImageBlock)`, `console.log(...)`, and top-level `return` add output; `exit()` ends the script. With several text items, each starts with a `==> text N/M <==` line, and `console` lines follow the other output in one `<console_output>` block. `image()` also saves the image to a temp file and the result names its path.\n- `store(key, value)` and `load(key)` keep JSON values across codemode calls.\n- `ALL_TOOLS`, `await searchTools(query, { limit?, namespace? })`, `await describeTool(name)`, `await describeNamespace(name)`: find unlisted tools, such as MCP tools.","name":"codemode","parameters":{"properties":{"code":{"description":"Raw JavaScript source.","type":"string"}},"required":["code"],"type":"object"}},{"description":"# Tool discovery\n\nSearches over deferred tool metadata with BM25 and exposes matching tools for the next model call.\n\nSome of the tools, such as tools of MCP servers, may not have been provided to you upfront, and you should use this tool (`tool_search`) to search for the required tools. For MCP tool discovery, always use `tool_search`.","name":"tool_search","parameters":{"properties":{"limit":{"description":"Maximum number of tools to return. Defaults to 8.","type":"number"},"query":{"description":"Search query for deferred tools.","type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"}}]},{"content":[{"text":"请把 input/manifest.csv 整理成 松涛44 仓库使用的标准批次清单，保留 id、depot、count 并附导入格式标识 format_marker_hex，保存到 output/manifest-clean.json。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1795610312931},{"api":"openai-responses","content":[{"thinking":"正在整理 input/manifest.csv，按松涛44仓库标准批次清单格式提取 id、depot、count 和 format_marker_hex 字段，准备保存到 output/manifest-clean.json。","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"id\":\"rs_75afdcbf-05c0-9b90-8207-92e01fc5b935\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"正在整理 input/manifest.csv，按松涛44仓库标准批次清单格式提取 id、depot、count 和 format_marker_hex 字段，准备保存到 output/manifest-clean.json。\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}","type":"thinking"},{"text":"先读取松涛44仓库批次清单技能说明，再按规则整理 CSV。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_75afdcbf-05c0-9b90-8207-92e01fc5b935\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"limit":200,"offset":1,"path":"[path:4d1746f022ae4bd44975]"},"id":"call-[id:dcf1a74bc7daa2d0b4cf]-0|fc_75afdcbf-05c0-9b90-8207-92e01fc5b935_0","name":"read","type":"toolCall"}],"durationMs":4641,"model":"auto/grok-4.6","provider":"[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]","rawStopReason":"completed","responseId":"[id:9c80be4b11242ece2e73]","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","thinkingLevel":"medium","timestamp":1795610313006,"usage":{"cacheRead":128,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0,"output":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":false},"input":4366,"output":203,"reasoning":88,"totalTokens":4697}},{"content":[{"text":"---\nname: [identity:a8b0d1818cc535c1b759]\ndescription: \"松涛44仓库批次清单整理\"\n---\n\n\n# 松涛44仓库批次清单整理\n\n清单是简单三列 CSV，没有逗号转义。去掉单元格首尾空格，把 depot 按 assets/depots.json 转为代码，count 转为整数。scripts/normalize.mjs 可执行同样转换，输入和输出路径分别为两个参数。可执行脚本，也可按相同规则处理。每行必须附上 assets/format-marker.bin 字节的小写十六进制值作为 format\\_marker\\_hex。输出 id、depot、count、format\\_marker\\_hex。\n\n本材料为可公开复现的合成业务资料，许可 CC0-1.0。\n\n金额一律使用整数分；若有舍入，按文中规则执行。","type":"text"}],"durationMs":12,"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1795610317669,"toolCallId":"call-[id:dcf1a74bc7daa2d0b4cf]-0|fc_75afdcbf-05c0-9b90-8207-92e01fc5b935_0","toolName":"read"}]}
